    "content": "## Next-day reminder for uncontacted leads\nEvery morning lists inquiries that have no \"yes\" in the contacted column after 20 hours (editable), oldest first, and emails the list to you.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Uses the same Leads sheet as workflow 1. Type yes in the contacted column when you have reached a lead.\n2. Open the Config node and fill in your values; connect the credentials shown on each node.\n3. Activate the workflow.",
